@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam classBorderColor #6C757D
skinparam arrowColor #495057
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

actor "User A" as UserA
actor "User B" as UserB
participant Frontend
participant "Backend API" as Backend
participant Liveblocks
database Database

UserA -> Frontend : Open section
Frontend -> Frontend : Derive room id\nproject:{project_id}:document:{document_id}:section:{section_id}
Frontend -> Backend : POST .../collaboration/auth
Backend -> Database : Verify membership
Backend -> Database : Resolve permission
Backend -> Liveblocks : authorize-user
Liveblocks --> Backend : Token
Backend --> Frontend : Liveblocks token
Frontend -> Liveblocks : Connect to room

UserB -> Frontend : Open same section
Frontend -> Backend : POST .../collaboration/auth
Backend -> Database : Verify membership
Backend -> Database : Resolve permission
Backend -> Liveblocks : authorize-user
Liveblocks --> Backend : Token
Backend --> Frontend : Liveblocks token
Frontend -> Liveblocks : Join same room
Liveblocks --> Frontend : Presence and cursor updates

UserB -> Frontend : Edit content
Frontend -> Liveblocks : Yjs CRDT update
Liveblocks --> Frontend : Sync update to User A
Frontend --> UserA : Editors converge

... debounced collaborative snapshot ...
Frontend -> Frontend : Convert state to Markdown
Frontend -> Backend : PATCH .../collaboration/snapshot
Backend -> Database : Validate permission and status
Backend -> Database : Update sections.content_md
Backend -> Database : Create SectionVersion

note right of Database
Associations to Document, Section, User, Project,
Analysis, and GenerationRun are defined in their
respective class diagrams.
end note
@enduml
